</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Condition_variables\">Condition variables</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><strong class=\"selflink\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></strong></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code><b>cnd_t</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> condition variable identifier\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_init\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_init</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   creates a condition variable  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_signal\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_signal</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   unblocks one thread blocked on a condition variable  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_broadcast\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_broadcast</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   unblocks all threads blocked on a condition variable  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_wait\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_wait</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   blocks on a condition variable  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_timedwait\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_timedwait</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   blocks on a condition variable, with a timeout  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_destroy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_destroy</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   destroys a condition variable  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Thread-local_storage\">Thread-local storage</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><strong class=\"selflink\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></strong></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thread_local\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>thread_local</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c23\">(removed in C23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  convenience macro for storage-class specifier <span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">_Thread_local</span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(keyword macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code><b>tss_t</b></code>\n</td>\n<td>  thread-specific storage pointer </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/TSS_DTOR_ITERATIONS\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>TSS_DTOR_ITERATIONS</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   maximum number of times destructors are called  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(macro constant)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><code><b>tss_dtor_t</b></code></span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   function pointer type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, used for TSS destructor <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/tss_create\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tss_create</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   creates thread-specific storage pointer with a given destructor  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/tss_get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tss_get</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   reads from thread-specific storage  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/tss_set\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tss_set</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   write to thread-specific storage  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/tss_delete\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tss_delete</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   releases the resources held by a given thread-specific pointer   <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Reserved_identifiers\">Reserved identifiers</h3>\n<p>In future revisions of the C standard:\n</p>\n<ul><li> function names, type names, and enumeration constants that begin with either <code>cnd_</code>, <code>mtx_</code>, <code>thrd_</code>, or <code>tss_</code>, and a lowercase letter may be added to the declarations in the <code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code> header;\n</li><li> macros that begin with <code>ATOMIC_</code> and an uppercase letter may be added to the macros defined in the <a href=\"#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a> header;\n</li><li> typedef names that begin with either <code>atomic_</code> or <code>memory_</code>, and a lowercase letter may be added to the declarations in the <a href=\"#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a> header;\n</li><li> enumeration constants that begin with <code>memory_order_</code> and a lowercase letter may be added to the definition of the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/atomic/memory_order\">memory_order</a></span> type in the <a href=\"#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a> header;\n</li><li> function names that begin with <code>atomic_</code> and a lowercase letter may be added to the declarations in the <a href=\"#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a> header.\n</li></ul>\n<p>Identifiers reserved for functions names are always <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-c23\"><span>potentially</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span></span></span> reserved for use as identifiers with external linkage, while other identifiers list here are <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-c23\"><span>potentially</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span></span></span> reserved when <a href=\"#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a> is included.\n</p><p>Declaring, defining, or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#undef</span></span></code>ing such an identifier results in undefined behavior<span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-c23\"><span> if it is provided by the standard or implementation</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span></span></span>. Portable programs should not use those identifiers.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17 Atomics &lt;stdatomic.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26 Threads &lt;threads.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.31.8 Atomics &lt;stdatomic.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.31.15 Threads &lt;threads.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17 Atomics &lt;stdatomic.h&gt; (p: 200-209)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26 Threads &lt;threads.h&gt; (p: 274-283)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.31.8 Atomics &lt;stdatomic.h&gt; (p: 332)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.31.15 Threads &lt;threads.h&gt; (p: 333)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17 Atomics &lt;stdatomic.h&gt; (p: 273-286)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26 Threads &lt;threads.h&gt; (p: 376-387)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.31.8 Atomics &lt;stdatomic.h&gt; (p: 455-456)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.31.15 Threads &lt;threads.h&gt; (p: 456)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span><span>Concurrency support library</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"External_links\">External links</h3>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/libc/manual/html_node/ISO-C-Mutexes.html\" data-external=\"1\">GNU GCC Libc Manual: ISO C Mutexes</a>\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Threads","id":"Threads"},{"depth":3,"text":"Atomic operations","id":"Atomic_operations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Mutual exclusion","id":"Mutual_exclusion"},{"depth":3,"text":"Condition variables","id":"Condition_variables"},{"depth":3,"text":"Thread-local storage","id":"Thread-local_storage"},{"depth":3,"text":"Reserved identifiers","id":"Reserved_identifiers"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"},{"depth":3,"text":"External links","id":"External_links"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"}],"children":[{"path":"thread/call_once","title":"call_once, once_flag, ONCE_FLAG_INIT"},{"path":"thread/cnd_broadcast","title":"cnd_broadcast"},{"path":"thread/cnd_destroy","title":"cnd_destroy"},{"path":"thread/cnd_init","title":"cnd_init"},{"path":"thread/cnd_signal","title":"cnd_signal"},{"path":"thread/cnd_timedwait","title":"cnd_timedwait"},{"path":"thread/cnd_wait","title":"cnd_wait"},{"path":"thread/mtx_destroy","title":"mtx_destroy"},{"path":"thread/mtx_init","title":"mtx_init"},{"path":"thread/mtx_lock","title":"mtx_lock"},{"path":"thread/mtx_timedlock","title":"mtx_timedlock"},{"path":"thread/mtx_trylock","title":"mtx_trylock"},{"path":"thread/mtx_types","title":"mtx_plain, mtx_recursive, mtx_timed"},{"path":"thread/mtx_unlock","title":"mtx_unlock"},{"path":"thread/thrd_create","title":"thrd_create"},{"path":"thread/thrd_current","title":"thrd_current"},{"path":"thread/thrd_detach","title":"thrd_detach"},{"path":"thread/thrd_equal","title":"thrd_equal"},{"path":"thread/thrd_errors","title":"thrd_success, thrd_timedout, thrd_busy, thrd_nomem, thrd_error"},{"path":"thread/thrd_exit","title":"thrd_exit"},{"path":"thread/thrd_join","title":"thrd_join"},{"path":"thread/thrd_sleep","title":"thrd_sleep"},{"path":"thread/thrd_yield","title":"thrd_yield"},{"path":"thread/thread_local","title":"thread_local"},{"path":"thread/tss_create","title":"tss_create"},{"path":"thread/tss_delete","title":"tss_delete"},{"path":"thread/TSS_DTOR_ITERATIONS","title":"TSS_DTOR_ITERATIONS"},{"path":"thread/tss_get","title":"tss_get"},{"path":"thread/tss_set","title":"tss_set"}],"map":{"label":"Concurrency support library","children":[{"label":"Threads","children":[{"label":"thrd_t","note":"implementation-defined complete object type identifying a thread"},{"label":"thrd_create","note":"creates a thread"},{"label":"thrd_equal","note":"checks if two identifiers refer to the same thread"},{"label":"thrd_current","note":"obtains the current thread identifier"},{"label":"thrd_sleep","note":"suspends execution of the calling thread for the given period of time"},{"label":"+6 more"}]},{"label":"Atomic operations","children":[{"label":"ATOMIC_BOOL_LOCK_FREE, ATOMIC_CHAR_LOCK_FREE…","note":"indicates that the given atomic type is lock-free"},{"label":"atomic_is_lock_free","note":"indicates whether the atomic object is lock-free"},{"label":"atomic_store, atomic_store_explicit","note":"stores a value in an atomic object"},{"label":"atomic_load, atomic_load_explicit","note":"reads a value from an atomic object"},{"label":"atomic_exchange, atomic_exchange_explicit","note":"swaps a value with the value of an atomic object"},{"label":"+54 more"}]},{"label":"Mutual exclusion","children":[{"label":"mtx_t","note":"mutex identifier"},{"label":"mtx_init","note":"creates a mutex"},{"label":"mtx_lock","note":"blocks until locks a mutex"},{"label":"mtx_ti